        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1160-T6-T1, 9 Inch Offset Commercial Door Pull  Type 6 & Type 1 Mounting</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 9 inch Center to Center (CTC) commercial offset door pull is made from 1 inch diameter solid round bar stock. The top mount is surface mount and bottom mount is through bolt.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1160_size.gif?v=1704354720\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1160 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1160 9\" Offset Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Anodized Aluminum</b></li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset for Mounting Point: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>For 1.75 inch metal storefront door.</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Top Hole Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Bottom Hole Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1160.pdf?v=1704262261\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1160 Offset Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> <b>Custom item, NOT Returnable</b>\r\n</p>",
